{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">恒生指數中午收報24,486點，跌155點。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">吉利汽車跌百分之7.2，比亞迪股份跌百分之3.6，中國海外升百分之4.7，龍湖升百分之3.7。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T04:39:43.199744+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":70,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}